\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s22 \cgrid \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \s22\fi-360\li360\sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls2\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\ls2\adjustright \cgrid {
Added  16-bit DMA option for second channel playback.
\par }\pard\plain \s2\sb120\sa120\keepn\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\outlinelevel1\adjustright \b\i\f1\cgrid {{\*\bkmkstart _Toc394309230}Version 4.16.98 Features{\*\bkmkend _Toc394309230}
\par }\pard\plain \sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright \cgrid {{\*\bkmkstart _Toc394308674}The following features have been incorporated:{\*\bkmkend _Toc394308674}
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s22 \cgrid \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 1.\tab}}\pard\plain \s22\fi-360\li360\sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls3\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\ls3\adjustright \cgrid {
Full-Duplex support : The driver supports simultaneous playback and recording of two stereo wave files, with independent sample rates. 
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s22 \cgrid \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 2.\tab}}\pard \s22\fi-360\li360\sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls3\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\ls3\adjustright {
ESFM support : The  driver supports ESFM, ESS\rquote  advanced FM music synthesis technology.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s22 \cgrid \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 3.\tab}}\pard \s22\fi-360\li360\sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls3\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\ls3\adjustright {
APM support : The driver supports Advanced Power Management(APM). It is recommended that users stop audio applications before putting the system into Suspend mode.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s22 \cgrid \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 4.\tab}}\pard \s22\fi-360\li360\sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls3\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\ls3\adjustright {
Hardware volume control support.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s22 \cgrid \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 5.\tab}}\pard \s22\fi-360\li360\sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls3\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\ls3\adjustright {
ESPCM & ADPCM compression support for playback and recording.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\s22 \cgrid \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 6.\tab}}\pard \s22\fi-360\li360\sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx360{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls3\pnrnot0\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnhang{\pntxta .}}\ls3\adjustright {
3D support : The driver supports 3-D stereo audio effects using Spatializer}{{\field{\*\fldinst SYMBOL 212 \\f "Symbol" \\s 12}{\fldrslt\f3\fs24}}}{ technology.
\par }\pard \s22\sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {\ul 
\par }\pard\plain \s1\sb120\sa120\keepn\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\outlinelevel0\adjustright \b\f1\fs32\kerning28\cgrid {{\*\bkmkstart _Toc394309231}{\*\bkmkend _Toc318715879}Known Problems{\*\bkmkend _Toc394309231}
\par }\pard\plain \sb120\sa120\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright \cgrid {To be found.
